      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In 1988, Korea hosted the Summer Olympic Games and in 2002, the World Cup was held in Korea, too.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I am very proud of my country and what it has accomplished during its long history.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From then until now, the country has continued to grow rapidly.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Since the end of the war in 1953, the country began to develop very quickly, especially during the 1970’s.",
